" /></a></div></div><div class="flex-1 p-5 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-theme-primary/10 text-theme-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs">SC</span><div class="max-w-md rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none bg-surface-100 dark:bg-surface-800 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-secondary-700 dark:text-secondary-200">Hi! Have you seen the latest dashboard preview?</div></div><div class="flex gap-3 justify-end"><div class="max-w-md rounded-2xl rounded-tr-none bg-theme-primary text-white px-4 py-3 text-sm">Yes, it looks great. I will review the details today.</div></div></div><div class="p-4 border-t border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 flex gap-2"><input class="input-theme" placeholder="Type a message..." /><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-4 rounded-xl"><Icon icon={Icons.send} className="w-5 h-5" /></button></div></div></div>
  {:else if isEcommerce}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="lg:col-span-2 card rounded-xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{title}</h2><p class="text-sm text-secondary-500 mt-1">Manage your catalog and orders.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm" on:click={() => goto('/app/ecommerce/products/create')}>Add product</button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">{#each products as product}<div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 p-4 hover:border-theme-primary"><div class="h-36 rounded-xl bg-surface-100 dark:bg-surface-800 flex items-center justify-center"><Icon icon={Icons.package} className="w-12 h-12 text-secondary-300" /></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{product.name}</p><p class="text-xs text-secondary-500 mt-1">{product.category}</p></div><p class="font-bold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{product.price}</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4"><span class={`text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full ${product.status === 'Active' ? 'bg-success-100 text-success-700' : 'bg-warning-100 text-warning-700'}`}>{product.status}</span><a href="/app/ecommerce/products/1" class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-primary">View details</a></div></div>{/each}</div></div><div class="card rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">Order summary</h3><div class="mt-6 space-y-4">{#each [['Subtotal','$1,240.00'],['Shipping','$24.00'],['Tax','$126.40']] as item}<div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-secondary-500">{item[0]}</span><span class="text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{item[1]}</span></div>{/each}<div class="pt-4 border-t border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 flex justify-between font-bold"><span>Total</span><span>$1,390.40</span></div><a href="/app/ecommerce/checkout" class="block w-full btn-theme-primary text-center py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold mt-5">Checkout</a></div></div></div>
  {:else if path === '/app/notes'}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[300px_1fr] gap-6"><div class="card rounded-xl p-4"><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold" on:click={() => (noteText = '')}><Icon icon={Icons.plus} className="w-4 h-4 inline me-2" />New note</button><div class="mt-5 space-y-2">{#each ['Project roadmap','Ideas for Q4','Meeting notes','Reading list'] as note, i}<button type="button" class={`w-full p-3 rounded-xl text-left ${i === 0 ? 'bg-theme-primary-light' : 'hover:bg-surface-50 dark:hover:bg-surface-800'}`}><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{note}</p><p class="text-xs text-secondary-500 mt-1">Updated {i + 1} hours ago</p></button>{/each}</div></div><div class="card rounded-xl p-6"><input class="w-full text-2xl font-bold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white bg-transparent border-0 focus:outline-none" value="Project roadmap" /><textarea bind:value={noteText} class="w-full min-h-[380px] mt-6 bg-transparent border-0 focus:outline-none text-body text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-300" placeholder="Start writing your note..."></textarea><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 pt-4"><span class="text-xs text-secondary-400">Saved locally</span><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm">Save note</button></div></div></div>
  {:else if path === '/app/kanban'}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">{#each [{name:'To do',color:'bg-surface-400',items:tasks.slice(0,2)},{name:'In progress',color:'bg-theme-primary',items:tasks.slice(2,3)},{name:'Done',color:'bg-success-500',items:tasks.slice(3)}] as column}<div class="card rounded-xl p-4 bg-surface-50/60 dark:bg-surface-900/60"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class={`w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${column.color}`}></span><h3 class="font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{column.name}</h3><span class="text-xs text-secondary-400">{column.items.length}</span></div><button type="button" class="p-1 text-secondary-400" on:click={() => (modalOpen = true)}><Icon icon={Icons.plus} className="w-4 h-4" /></button></div><div class="space-y-3 min-h-40">{#each column.items as task}<div class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm border border-surface-200/70 dark:border-surface-700"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class={`px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs text-white ${task.color}`}>{task.tag}</span><button type="button" class="text-secondary-400"><Icon icon={Icons.dotsVertical} className="w-4 h-4" /></button></div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white mt-3">{task.title}</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4 text-xs text-secondary-400"><span><Icon icon={Icons.calendar} className="w-3.5 h-3.5 inline me-1" />Today</span><span>2/4</span></div></div>{/each}</div></div>{/each}</div>
  {:else if path.startsWith('/pages/')}
    {#if path === '/pages/pricing'}<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">{#each [{name:'Starter',price:'$9',items:['5 team members','10 GB storage','Basic analytics']},{name:'Professional',price:'$29',popular:true,items:['25 team members','100 GB storage','Advanced analytics','Priority support']},{name:'Enterprise',price:'$99',items:['Unlimited members','Unlimited storage','Custom integrations','Dedicated manager']}] as plan}<div class={`card rounded-3xl p-7 relative ${plan.popular ? 'border-2 border-theme-primary shadow-xl' : ''}`}>{#if plan.popular}<span class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-theme-primary text-white px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">Most popular</span>{/if}<h3 class="heading-5 text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{plan.name}</h3><p class="text-display-price text-secondary-900 dark:text-white mt-6">{plan.price}<span class="text-sm text-secondary-500"> / month</span></p><div class="mt-8 space-y-3">{#each plan.items as item}<p class="text-sm text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-300 flex items-center gap-2"><Icon icon={Icons.check} className="w-4 h-4 text-theme-primary" />{item}</p>{/each}</div><button type="button" class={`w-full mt-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold ${plan.popular ? 'btn-theme-primary' : 'border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700'}`}>Get started</button></div>{/each}</div>{:else if path === '/pages/gallery'}<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">{#each Array(12) as _, i}<button type="button" class="aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-theme-primary/20 via-purple-500/20 to-cyan-500/20 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform" on:click={() => { galleryIndex = i; galleryOpen = true }}><Icon icon={Icons.photo} className="w-10 h-10 text-theme-primary/50" /><span class="sr-only">Gallery image {i + 1}</span></button>{/each}</div>{:else if path === '/pages/faq'}<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">{#each ['How do I customize the theme?','Can I use the dashboard without a backend?','Are the charts responsive?','How do I switch to RTL?','Where is my data stored?'] as question, i}<div class="card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between text-left" on:click={() => (activeTab = activeTab === String(i) ? '' : String(i))}><span class="font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{question}</span><Icon icon={activeTab === String(i) ? Icons.minus : Icons.plus} className="w-5 h-5 text-theme-primary" /></button>{#if activeTab === String(i)}<p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">Adminex keeps this behavior in a typed, reusable Svelte component with localStorage persistence.</p>{/if}</div>{/each}</div>{:else if path === '/pages/account-settings'}<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[240px_1fr] gap-6"><div class="card rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">{#each ['Profile','Security','Notifications','Billing'] as tab}<button type="button" class={`w-full text-left px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm ${activeTab === tab ? 'bg-theme-primary-light text-theme-primary font-semibold' : 'text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-300 hover:bg-surface-100 dark:hover:bg-surface-800'}`} on:click={() => (activeTab = tab)}>{tab}</button>{/each}</div><div class="card rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{activeTab}</h2><div class="mt-6 max-w-xl space-y-5"><div><label for="settings-name" class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Full name</label><input id="settings-name" class="input-theme" value="Admin User" /></div><div><label for="settings-email" class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Email</label><input id="settings-email" class="input-theme" value="admin@example.com" /></div><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Save changes</button></div></div></div>{:else}<div class="card rounded-xl p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">Typography scale</h2><div class="mt-8 space-y-6"><h1 class="text-4xl">Heading one</h1><h2 class="text-3xl">Heading two</h2><h3 class="text-2xl">Heading three</h3><p class="text-lg">Body text with the Rethink Sans type system.</p><p class="text-sm text-secondary-500">Caption and supporting text use the shared design tokens.</p><pre><code>const adminex = 'SvelteKit'</code></pre></div></div>{/if}
  {:else if isFeature}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="xl:col-span-2 card rounded-xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-theme-primary/10 text-theme-primary flex items-center justify-center"><Icon icon={feature.icon} className="w-6 h-6" /></div><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">{feature.accent} workspace</h2><p class="text-sm text-secondary-500">Local mock state is ready for interactive editing.</p></div></div>{#if path === '/features/rule-engine'}<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800/60 p-5"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><h3 class="font-semibold">Rules</h3><button type="button" class="text-theme-primary" on:click={() => (modalOpen = true)}><Icon icon={Icons.plus} /></button></div>{#each ['High value customer','Abandoned cart','New account'] as rule}<div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700"><p class="text-sm font-semibold">{rule}</p><p class="text-xs text-secondary-500 mt-1">2 conditions · Active</p></div>{/each}</div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800/60 p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold">Test rule</h3><select class="input-theme mt-4"><option>High value customer</option><option>Abandoned cart</option></select><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg mt-4">Run test</button><div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-lg bg-success-100 text-success-700 text-sm">Rule matched successfully.</div></div></div>{:else if path === '/features/query-builder'}<div class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-theme-primary/40 p-8 text-center"><Icon icon={Icons.queryBuilder} className="w-10 h-10 text-theme-primary mx-auto" /><h3 class="heading-4 mt-4">Build a query</h3><p class="text-sm text-secondary-500 mt-2">Add conditions to shape your result set.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-6 text-left"><select class="input-theme py-2"><option>Status</option><option>Created at</option></select><select class="input-theme py-2"><option>is equal to</option><option>contains</option></select><input class="input-theme py-2" placeholder="Value" /></div><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg mt-5">Run query</button></div>{:else}<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">{#each [{label:'Active',value:'24'},{label:'Pending',value:'08'},{label:'Completed',value:'142'}] as metric}<div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800/60 p-5"><p class="text-sm text-secondary-500">{metric.label}</p><p class="heading-2 text-secondary-900 dark:text-white mt-2">{metric.value}</p><div class="h-2 bg-surface-200 dark:bg-surface-700 rounded-full mt-4 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-theme-primary rounded-full" style={`width:${Math.max(25, Number(metric.value))}%`}></div></div></div>{/each}</div><div class="mt-6"><ChartCanvas type="line" data={chartData.line} height={260} /></div>{/if}</div><div class="card rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">Activity</h3><div class="space-y-4 mt-5">{#each ['Configuration saved','New item created','Test completed','Export generated'] as event, i}<div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 mt-2 rounded-full bg-theme-primary"></span><div><p class="text-sm text-secondary-700 dark:text-secondary-200">{event}</p><p class="text-xs text-secondary-400 mt-1">{i + 1} hour ago</p></div></div>{/each}</div><button type="button" class="w-full mt-7 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 text-sm">View activity</button></div></div>
  {:else}
    <div class="card rounded-xl p-8"><div class="max-w-2xl"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-theme-primary/10 text-theme-primary flex items-center justify-center"><Icon icon={Icons.dashboard} className="w-7 h-7" /></div><h2 class="heading-3 text-secondary-900 dark:text-white mt-6">{title}</h2><p class="text-body text-secondary-500 mt-3">{subtitle}</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">{#each [{label:'Total',value:'2,480'},{label:'Active',value:'1,824'},{label:'Updated',value:'Today'}] as item}<div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800/60 p-4"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary-400">{item.label}</p><p class="heading-4 text-secondary-900 dark:text-white mt-2">{item.value}</p></div>{/each}</div></div></div>
  {/if}
</div>

<GalleryLightbox bind:open={galleryOpen} bind:index={galleryIndex} />
{#if modalOpen}<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[1100] flex items-center justify-center p-4"><button type="button" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50" aria-label="Close dialog" on:click={() => (modalOpen = false)}></button><div class="relative w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 shadow-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h2 class="heading-4 text-secondary-900 dark:text-white">Create new item</h2><button type="button" class="p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-100 dark:hover:bg-surface-800" on:click={() => (modalOpen = false)}><Icon icon={Icons.close} className="w-5 h-5" /></button></div><div class="space-y-4 mt-6"><input class="input-theme" placeholder="Name" /><textarea class="input-theme" rows="4" placeholder="Description"></textarea></div><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 mt-6"><button type="button" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700" on:click={() => (modalOpen = false)}>Cancel</button><button type="button" class="btn-theme-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-lg" on:click={() => (modalOpen = false)}>Create</button></div></div></div>{/if}
